cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "RACH: Restricted Admissible Causal Hypotheses"
abstract: >-
  A constraint-aware framework for diagnosing causal degeneracy and prioritising
  the next observation in ecological mechanism inference. Defines an admissible
  region over mechanism-switch combinations, reports causal degeneracy instead of
  collapsing to a single best model, and computes a next-observation value (NOV)
  as a constructive expected-value-of-sample-information on causal resolvability.
